=A2n kim, 3. NV MC). Sau khi x=C3=A1c nh=E1=BA=ADn, =C4=91=E1=BB=95i tr=E1=
=BA=A1ng th=C3=A1i phi=E1=BA=BFu th=C3=A0nh<span>&nbsp;</span><code>=C4=90a=
ng x=E1=BB=AD l=C3=BD</code>.</li>
